{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57443","headline":"句 十三 · 无名氏","name":"句 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积翠彻（王利器疑当作「澈」）深潭，舒丹明浅濑。\n（以上三联爲菁华体）（以上十三联均见《文镜秘府论》地卷《十体》引崔融《唐朝新定诗格》）（按：《十体》节共引诗二十一题，今可查知作者之作凡八题，分属宋鲍照、齐王融、梁戴暠、陈江总、隋杨广、孔德绍、虞世基、唐崔信明。\n不知作者之作凡十三联，当爲六朝至初唐人所作，惜已无从甄辨。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}